+# block_timeline Upgrade notes
+
+## 5.3dev
+
+### Added
+
+- The block content is now rendered through a new `\block_timeline\output\main` renderable, which implements `\core\output\react_renderable` and mounts the Timeline React component via the standard PHP React mounting API. A `\block_timeline\output\renderer` class has been added so that themes may override the rendering by providing a `render_main` method.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-89296](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-89296)
